          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "悪徳業者は、言葉巧みに高齢者からお金を絞り上げた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼はいつも部下から無理やり仕事を絞り上げようとする。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "高い税金で国民からお金を絞り上げるのはやめてほしい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "to scold",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "上司に書類の不備を厳しく絞り上げられ、すっかり落ち込んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「また遅刻して！いい加減にしなさい！」と、母は息子を絞り上げた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼はチームのミスを自分のことのように責任を感じ、監督に絞り上げられた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "to train ruthlessly",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
